\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"summary\"], \"title\": \"schema\", \"type\": \"object\"}}", "{\"summary\":\"No payment was executed because there is no execution result object, indicating that no transfer was made. This may be due to ambiguity or missing information required to process the payment.\"}", 1238412061]]}
